# The info box's editor summary spells its chords for the active profile
# (src/app/info_view.zig `chordOf`): the standard profile reads VS Code's
# F12 / Shift+F12 / Ctrl+K Ctrl+I, the vim profile gd / gr / K. The box
# wraps its body across the sidebar's rows, so each chord is checked on
# its own.
write hello.txt "word\n"
open hello.txt
expect screen contains "[F12] Definition"
expect screen lacks "[gd] Definition"
command editor.use_vim
expect screen contains "[gd] Definition"
expect screen lacks "[F12] Definition"
